abstract: "A reusable analysis framework and writing style tool based on Philip Fisher's public methodology, including the Scuttlebutt Method, Fifteen Points checklist, Growth Stock Investment Philosophy, Long-term Holding principles, Management Quality Assessment, and Concentrated Investing approach. Designed to assist in evaluating corporate growth prospects, management quality, R&D innovation, and long-term holding value. This skill provides an investment analysis framework and writing style calibration, and does NOT claim to represent Philip Fisher personally or his unpublished views."
