notes: "Philip Fisher passed away on March 11, 2004. All public views included in this framework are from sources dated on or before that date. Warren Buffett has stated that his investment philosophy is '85% Graham and 15% Fisher.' In Chinese-language contexts, Philip Fisher is commonly referred to as '小费雪' (Small Fisher) to distinguish him from Irving Fisher ('大费雪', Big Fisher), the monetary economics pioneer."
